# Overview

This repository contains personal C# libraries and Unity packages.

- candy-common: Library for all projects
- candy-aspnet: Library for my ASP.NET projects
- candy-blazor: Library for my Blazor projects (WASM)
- candy-discord: Library for my Discord bots
- candy-unity: Package for my Unity projects
- unity-assets: Packages from different sources